    "created_at": "2022-05-06T15:53:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-05-06T15:53:37Z",
    "body": "I'm very annoyed that &lt;h&gt; tag hasn't been added to the spec yet. As a web developer, I have been suffering from the lack of this tag for many years, in the absence of which I have to use &lt;h1&gt;-&lt;h6&gt; tags, which creates a lot of problems when splitting an internal application structure into modules. Like many other web developers, I look forward to when this tag will appear in the specification. Please consider adding &lt;h&gt; tag to the specification.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
