    "body": "@RokeJulianLockhart from the OP:\n\n> On the other hand, using `<h1>` everywhere and relying upon the outline algorithm makes an incorrect and contradictory assertion; every heading is of '1' level.\n\n`headlinglevelstart` solves this limitation, allowing the included source to start with `h1`, and the includer can offset the values accordingly. The linked `auto` proposal makes this even easier.",
